AUDIT CONCLUSION:
1. Physical Gate Preservation: All 16 multiplier replica inverters, 18 carry replica
   inverters, and 14 tapped delay line inverters (48 total) are mapped to genuine
   sky130_fd_sc_hd__inv_1 standard cell primitives with keep/dont_touch attributes.
2. Dual-Replica Integrity: Both critical paths survive synthesis without logic reduction
   or identity collapse into direct-wire assignments.
3. Physical Separation: Each tap (tap_wire[1] through tap_wire[7]) is driven by a unique
   non-inverting dual-inverter buffer stage with distinct input and output nets.
4. Sampling Fidelity: The sampling registers capture 8 distinct physical points along the
   propagating wavefront across both operating paths, solving critical-path masking.
